The '''Ruins of Birkhaven''' are what remains of the city of '''Birkhaven''', located in northeastern [[Northwind]]. Once ruled by [[Duke Johnathan Sherwood]] and his family, it has now fallen to the [[Blackrock clan|Blackrock]] [[orc]]s and [[Dark Iron dwarf|Dark Iron dwarves]] that now war over the ruins.

